# Title: DotNET Assembly DLL Loaded Via Office Application
# ID: ff0f2b05-09db-4095-b96d-1b75ca24894a
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Antonlovesdnb
# Date: 2020-02-19
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1204.002
# Description: Detects any assembly DLL being loaded by an Office Product
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process_name:*\\excel.exe OR process_name:*\\mspub.exe OR process_name:*\\onenote.exe OR process_name:*\\onenoteim.exe OR process_name:*\\outlook.exe OR process_name:*\\powerpnt.exe OR process_name:*\\winword.exe) AND ImageLoaded:C:\\Windows\\assembly\\*)
